rthspline_0.1.0-beta.24-25_amd64.deb"}],"build":25,"channel":"beta","notes":["Northspline uses much less additional memory over time while it stays open and repositories keep changing.","Reduced memory growth as new commits arrive in History on Linux. History content is temporarily unavailable to Linux screen readers while this workaround is in place.","Repository tabs can be renamed: click the active tab again, or choose Rename tab… from its menu.","Repository tabs can be grouped. Each group gets a name and a colour, and collapses to a single chip when you click it. Groups come back when you reopen Northspline.","The commit description grows with the commit area: drag the divider above it to make room for longer messages, and double-click the divider to return.","Dividers between panes now show where to drag when you point at them.","When a commit's ancestry is highlighted in History, the other commits' text fades with their lines.","A filter above the changed files narrows the Unstaged and Staged lists by path. Staging, unstaging or discarding everything then acts only on the files you see."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.24-25","version":"0.1.0-beta.24"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15563256,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"44b8270968f715e3bb2f7dd07461979338e2b0fe98cf067bc35a0db461c7abdc","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15979073,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"0c99651798dcd7466b79aeeb50a61ee21cf316a6ac8ed50607970f7b0082aa34","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":17234160,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"1ef5cfba4faf34368175182e2a29276e653573ccbe2aee127358efdf9cef75f8","update_signature":"zyfz4nOM42Gunhq22i0kHwso1b7Q+WTn7E+DyUdrSZmu2rjFgSY4X5DI3I38xZh02cZ5yaHcxuBSjxkYbsYcCQ==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":14434304,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"8bf461129d622c93937530e01f2fe3ebed09ac0c4e50f2ec6c6a8a835931aee0","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":16026002,"file":"northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"e1c6392e0867c954e89c0bcdf7b8eabae36607fd5c3c62ea499e1025f70d265b","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/northspline-0.1.0-beta.21-22.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":16025840,"file":"northspline_0.1.0-beta.21-22_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"d00da9ee8793d3bfe158e38bac37f4a43c0a7feb63de32fa8abc780dbc44bdf9","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.21-22/northspline_0.1.0-beta.21-22_amd64.deb"}],"build":22,"channel":"beta","notes":["Large repositories respond faster after a pull, fetch, checkout, commit or staging: Northspline now rescans the repository once instead of twice, and History updates about a second earlier in a repository of 63,000 files.","The Logbook no longer fills with failed \"Refresh repository\" entries in large repositories, and an operation that finished is no longer reported as needing attention only because the following refresh took long.","The warning that repository changes \"arrived faster than they could be displayed\" no longer appears after Northspline's own pull or checkout.","A running fetch, pull or push now shows what it is doing and how far it is, for example \"Pull · Updating files 85%\". Downloads of Git LFS files are shown as their own step.","The Logbook lists your operations without the \"Git operation\" entries that every refresh added.","When you pull with uncommitted changes, the Pull dialog now asks you to confirm before you can start, instead of failing after it closed.","While a repository opens, the toolbar shows its branch instead of \"Detached HEAD\".","Closing a repository tab during a running operation can no longer hang.","After a pull, History scrolls to the new HEAD and selects it, so the commits you just pulled are in view."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.21-22","version":"0.1.0-beta.21"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15563256,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"79d7be530b2d2495c5ffc47c71ef5253a3cdfa7d1f16f56e8f809891a45f9a7d","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15974194,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"1c1d603a96ab471d5b79fb93956d16ab475135a26d0efd2b3bd481c9c963a2ea","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":17238237,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"8f6be9edb1f2b5dfb5d13f49762fcbdac5e8b500f0b02d5053ce995f7da7d861","update_signature":"bwInSvIW6S8qP3hzstbAJTWYN/FX06Airwk7tnu49PsG2zWk09L6uTHPI3FyaWWPQscs4EoaGvdi8R4sT7UDCA==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":14434304,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"8c52179142df7c89fad3351069a38b28a0bdce74f41628f7ca4aedfbc123b561","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21-windows-x86_64.msi"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":16017725,"file":"northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21.x86_64.rpm","format":"rpm","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"43abac10a0fc731e15ee61d4afb04f78aa8b3bbd2cbc7999d39f325c8eef3ca5","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/northspline-0.1.0-beta.20-21.x86_64.rpm"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":16016910,"file":"northspline_0.1.0-beta.20-21_amd64.deb","format":"deb","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"474c39ccd76e71c7bb7ed38db877df6f978e00788b55402bdf25c1458871def7","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.20-21/northspline_0.1.0-beta.20-21_amd64.deb"}],"build":21,"channel":"beta","notes":["On Linux, right-click menus and toolbar menus such as the Pull and Push options now open.","On Linux, Northspline now uses the title area like on macOS: the toolbar replaces the separate title bar and the window buttons sit at the right end of the toolbar.","History no longer blanks to placeholder rows while a repository refreshes after a slow pull or fetch; the graph and the open commit stay visible and update when the new state is ready.","Switching repositories now shows the details of the selected commit right away.","Selecting a branch in the sidebar that the branch filter hides now shows it in History for as long as it stays selected.","Selecting a tag or the newest stash in the sidebar also shows it in a filtered History.","Repositories with a branch filter now show their last known History immediately when you switch to them or start the app.","The toolbar has a Branch button next to Pull and Push.","A new branch is checked out as soon as it is created, and your uncommitted changes come along. Clear \"Check out the new branch\" in the dialog to only create it.","Undo no longer offers to remove a branch you are currently on.","GitHub Enterprise Cloud accounts on a `ghe.com` address can now be connected.","When a hosting connection fails, Northspline now says why, for example that the server could not be reached or does not know the address, instead of \"unavailable\".","Repository tabs that are not selected are now separated by a thin line, so each one reads as a tab.","A configured diff renderer that does not read its input no longer falls back to the built-in diff at random."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.20-21","version":"0.1.0-beta.20"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15530488,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.19-20-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"d650c7fb588196cfc34e5086a7c78025c6345affdb76db55d018e9459fc3df6a","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.19-20/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.19-20-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":15949841,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.19-20-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"730c23669ee9d64c32c613155e37b417fc2cbaaa486c43d0c5f93572ee72efb5","url":"https://github.com/devmil/NorthSpline/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.19-20/Northspline-0.1.0-beta.19-20-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":17232250,"file":"Northspline-0.1.0-beta.19-20-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","p